e later.\nFront Desk: Of course — feel free to call back when you’re ready to go ahead with a full project.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":202,"transcription_confidence":0.95,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":null,"client_phone":"[redacted in source]","client_email":null,"intent":"advice_only","project_type":"residential","scope_type":"single_room","scope_summary":"Living-room ideas only: colours, furniture arrangement.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":null,"location_clarity":"not_stated","in_service_area":null,"area_sqft":null,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":null,"weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"fail","service_area":"unclear","timeline":"unclear","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"unclear"},"criteria_notes":{"real_project":"Wants colour / layout suggestions, not design + execution."},"clarifying_question":null,"summary":"Caller wants advice on living-room colours and furniture arrangement, not a full design-and-execution project. Location not given. Told to call back when ready for a full project.","sentiment":"neutral","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.95,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1055,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":0.7338,"created_at":"2026-09-04T05:38:00.000Z"},{"id":"80a7b230-5a0e-4c33-a3eb-c1c8b7fb2515","enquiry_id":"cb513ec2-9279-4803-8f4b-f2f2731ece42","source":"audio","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"Front Desk: Good morning, Aangan Studio.\nCaller: Hi, this is Aarti Mehta. Vikram Agarwal asked me to call — he’s a close friend of Nikhil’s.\nFront Desk: Of course, thank you. What are you looking for?\nCaller: We have a 4BHK in Koregaon Park — about 2,400 sq ft carpet. Complete redesign. New flooring, kitchen, all four bedrooms. We’ve already moved out temporarily.\nFront Desk: That’s a significant project. Do you have a timeline?\nCaller: We want to move back in by February. About 4 months.\nFront Desk: That should work well. Would you prefer a site visit for the consultation?\nCaller: Yes please — Vikram said your team does that.\nFront Desk: Absolutely. Can I check your availability for early next week?","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":404,"transcription_confidence":0.97,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":"Aarti Mehta","client_phone":"[redacted in source]","client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"residential","scope_type":"full_home","scope_summary":"Complete redesign of a 4BHK: new flooring, kitchen, all four bedrooms. Currently vacated.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Koregaon Park, Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":2400,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":"Move back in by February (~4 months).","weeks_to_completion":17,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":"Vikram Agarwal (close friend of Nikhil)","founder_connection":true,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"pass","service_area":"pass","timeline":"pass","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"pass"},"criteria_notes":{},"clarifying_question":null,"summary":"Large 4BHK (~2,400 sq ft) in Koregaon Park, complete redesign, family already moved out, wants to return by February. Introduced by Vikram Agarwal, a close friend of Nikhil — treat as a priority. Site-visit consultation requested for early next week.","sentiment":"positive","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.97,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1078,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":1.3027,"created_at":"2026-09-05T05:23:00.000Z"},{"id":"97c64502-801a-483b-9176-f4f3617a0027","enquiry_id":"f5bb124f-4e07-4d6e-a01d-a649587c249f","source":"audio","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"Front Desk: Good afternoon, Aangan Studio.\nCaller: Hi, I’m calling about a commercial project. We’re a startup — just got our first proper office space in Baner. About 800 sq ft. We need workstations for 20 people, a small cabin, a meeting room, and a break area.\nFront Desk: We do commercial fitouts up to about 3,000 sq ft. What’s the state of the space right now?\nCaller: Bare shell — just columns and floor. Nothing else.\nFront Desk: Full fitout from scratch. And the timeline?\nCaller: We want to be operational by December. Our team is working from home currently.\nFront Desk: December is doable. Are you the decision-maker for this?\nCaller: Yes, I’m the founder.\nFront Desk: Perfect. Let’s set up a consultation.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":301,"transcription_confidence":0.96,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":null,"client_phone":"[redacted in source]","client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"commercial","scope_type":"office","scope_summary":"Full fitout of a bare-shell office: 20 workstations, small cabin, meeting room, break area.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Baner, Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":800,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":"Operational by December.","weeks_to_completion":13,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"pass","service_area":"pass","timeline":"pass","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"pass"},"criteria_notes":{},"clarifying_question":null,"summary":"Startup founder (decision-maker) needs a full fitout of an 800 sq ft bare-shell office in Baner — 20 workstations, cabin, meeting room, break area — operational by December. Consultation being set up.","sentiment":"positive","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.96,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1080,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":1.0126,"created_at":"2026-09-05T09:59:00.000Z"},{"id":"1ef4e5c0-4ef1-4d39-b65a-ba78c2a0b274","enquiry_id":"f8c81ad5-81fd-49ca-87a8-a1d33ccd1b5e","source":"audio","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"Front Desk: Good morning, Aangan Studio.\nCaller: Hello — I want to redo my living room and kitchen before Diwali. Can you take it up?\nFront Desk: Diwali is about three weeks away. Our design phase alone takes 3–4 weeks, and execution follows. We couldn’t do justice to a project in that time.\nCaller: Even just the living room?\nFront Desk: Even so — a room redesign with execution takes at least 8–10 weeks from start to finish. We wouldn’t want to rush it.\nCaller: What if I start after Diwali?\nFront Desk: A November start would work well. Shall I note your details for that?\nCaller: Let me think and call back.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":195,"transcription_confidence":0.94,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":null,"client_phone":"[redacted in source]","client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"residential","scope_type":"partial_home","scope_summary":"Living room and kitchen redesign.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":null,"location_clarity":"not_stated","in_service_area":null,"area_sqft":null,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":"Wanted it done before Diwali (~3 weeks); open to a post-Diwali (November) start.","weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"pass","service_area":"unclear","timeline":"unclear","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"unclear"},"criteria_notes":{"timeline":"Original deadline impossible, but caller is open to a November start.","service_area":"Location never stated."},"clarifying_question":"Which area is the property in?","summary":"Wants living room + kitchen redone before Diwali (~3 weeks) — not feasible. Caller is open to starting after Diwali and will call back. Location not captured.","sentiment":"neutral","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.94,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1054,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":0.7141,"created_at":"2026-09-08T04:15:00.000Z"},{"id":"801450c8-871f-4b1b-83b7-dfc4fff68022","enquiry_id":"7bcea0ff-d7a8-4929-9d41-cf62a4ddbcc1","source":"audio","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"Front Desk: Good morning, Aangan Studio.\nCaller: I need to speak to someone right now. My project has been going for three months and my designer hasn’t replied in five days. This is not acceptable.\nFront Desk: I’m very sorry. Can I take your name and project details?\nCaller: Sheetal Deshpande. My designer is Aryan. Flat in Viman Nagar — 2BHK. I’ve sent three messages and called twice.\nFront Desk: Sheetal, I’m getting this to our project team right now. Would you prefer to hold for two minutes, or should I have someone senior call you back within 15 minutes?\nCaller: Callback. And I want it from Nikhil or a senior person — not just whoever picks up.\nFront Desk: Noted. I’ll make sure of that.\nNote: Existing project complaint. Escalated to studio head immediately.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":352,"transcription_confidence":0.97,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":"Sheetal Deshpande","client_phone":"[redacted in source]","client_email":null,"intent":"existing_client_complaint","project_type":"residential","scope_type":null,"scope_summary":null,"scope_clarity":"not_stated","location":"Viman Nagar, Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":null,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":null,"weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"unclear","service_area":"unclear","timeline":"unclear","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"unclear"},"criteria_notes":{},"clarifying_question":null,"summary":"EXISTING CLIENT — not a new lead. Sheetal Deshpande (2BHK, Viman Nagar, designer Aryan) says her designer has not replied in five days after three messages and two calls, three months into the project. Wants a callback from Nikhil or a senior person within 15 minutes.","sentiment":"frustrated","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.97,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1093,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":1.1562,"created_at":"2026-09-10T06:03:00.000Z"},{"id":"29eb1799-f052-42b8-bf05-12a6335c7b33","enquiry_id":"cff0aaac-63f6-4f3a-82eb-45755a328d25","source":"audio","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"Front Desk: Good afternoon, Aangan Studio.\nCaller: Hi. I have a 1BHK in Kharadi — about 550 sq ft. I want to do the kitchen and one bedroom. My budget is 1 to 1.5 lakh maximum for everything. Is that possible with you?\nFront Desk: I appreciate you sharing that. For a kitchen redesign and a bedroom with full execution — materials, furniture, and contractor work — 1 to 1.5 lakh would be significantly below what a project of that scope would cost with us.\nCaller: Even for one bedroom?\nFront Desk: Even for one room. I wouldn’t want to bring you to a consultation if the numbers don’t align. I’d suggest checking with local contractors who work at that price point.\nCaller: Okay, thank you for being straight.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":220,"transcription_confidence":0.97,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":null,"client_phone":"[redacted in source]","client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"residential","scope_type":"partial_home","scope_summary":"Kitchen and one bedroom of a 1BHK, full execution.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Kharadi, Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":550,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":null,"weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":100000,"budget_high_inr":150000,"budget_flexibility":"rigid","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"pass","service_area":"pass","timeline":"unclear","budget":"fail","decision_maker":"unclear"},"criteria_notes":{},"clarifying_question":null,"summary":"Volunteered a ₹1–1.5 lakh maximum for a kitchen + bedroom with full execution in a 550 sq ft 1BHK in Kharadi — clearly below what that scope costs. Misalignment addressed on the call; not forwarded.","sentiment":"neutral","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.97,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1078,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":0.7845,"created_at":"2026-09-11T08:35:00.000Z"},{"id":"a0ba0328-a04a-4fdc-9038-68fabaeb3c2c","enquiry_id":"88d81a95-118a-4150-a044-7d23fbdfbd67","source":"audio","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"Front Desk: Good morning, Aangan Studio.\nCaller: Hi — I have a question. I’m in a rented apartment. Can you still take up a project?\nFront Desk: It depends on the scope. What are you looking to do?\nCaller: It’s a 2BHK in Baner. I’ve been here a year, I have a 3-year lease, and the place is quite bare. I want to properly design the living room, bedroom, and kitchen — no structural changes, just design and fittings.\nFront Desk: That’s fine — we’ve done rented apartments before. For the kitchen we’d do a modular unit that can come out cleanly. The rest is largely flooring, lighting, and furniture — all reversible. Have you checked with your landlord?\nCaller: Yes — they’re fine with it as long as we don’t break walls.\nFront Desk: Perfect. No wall-breaking from us. Shall we set up a consultation?\nCaller: Yes please.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":382,"transcription_confidence":0.96,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":null,"client_phone":"[redacted in source]","client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"residential","scope_type":"partial_home","scope_summary":"Design and fittings for living room, bedroom and kitchen of a rented 2BHK. No structural changes; landlord has agreed.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Baner, Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":null,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":null,"weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"pass","service_area":"pass","timeline":"unclear","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"pass"},"criteria_notes":{"timeline":"No timeline discussed."},"clarifying_question":"When would you need the project complete?","summary":"Tenant (3-year lease) of a 2BHK in Baner wants living room, bedroom and kitchen designed — no structural changes, landlord agreed. Consultation booked, but timeline and area were not discussed.","sentiment":"positive","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.96,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1106,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":1.2407,"created_at":"2026-09-12T04:49:00.000Z"},{"id":"f6914883-bd95-46c2-b2a9-66a84e7d2f52","enquiry_id":"0076457f-2ed7-4028-abe1-3df2c1e6b926","source":"audio","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"Front Desk: Good morning, Aangan Studio.\nCaller: I’m calling about a villa project in Kalyani Nagar. My name is Anand Sharma. The property is about 5,500 sq ft — ground plus two floors. Full end-to-end design.\nFront Desk: That’s a significant project. Is this a new property or an existing home?\nCaller: New construction. Possession was last month. Completely empty.\nFront Desk: And your timeline?\nCaller: March next year to move in. No rush.\nFront Desk: Good time to start. Would you like our principal designer to come to site for the first consultation?\nCaller: Yes — this week or next if possible.\nFront Desk: Let me check the calendar and revert by end of day.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":450,"transcription_confidence":0.97,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":"Anand Sharma","client_phone":"[redacted in source]","client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"residential","scope_type":"full_home","scope_summary":"Full end-to-end design of a new 5,500 sq ft villa (ground + two floors), currently empty.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Kalyani Nagar, Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":5500,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":"Move in March next year; no rush.","weeks_to_completion":25,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"pass","service_area":"pass","timeline":"pass","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"pass"},"criteria_notes":{},"clarifying_question":null,"summary":"New-construction villa in Kalyani Nagar, ~5,500 sq ft over three floors, empty and ready for full end-to-end design; move-in March. Wants the principal designer on site this week or next. Very large project.","sentiment":"positive","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.97,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1067,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":1.4322,"created_at":"2026-09-15T04:36:00.000Z"},{"id":"50acf000-5827-4648-907c-906ee2c5cd2f","enquiry_id":"4e3ea6f1-22d2-4f0b-83bf-28522e816388","source":"audio","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"Front Desk: Good afternoon, Aangan Studio.\nCaller: Hi — I want to redo my flat in Aundh. 3BHK, about 1,100 sq ft. What might it cost?\nFront Desk: Our pricing depends on the materials and scope — the designers go through that at the consultation. What are you planning?\nCaller: Kitchen, wardrobes in both bedrooms, living room. But seriously — can’t you give me even a rough range? I just want to know if we’re in the same ballpark.\nFront Desk: I really can’t give a number that would mean anything without seeing the site and the spec. The difference between a standard and a premium kitchen alone can be 3× the cost. The consultation is free — the designer will give you a proper number by the end of it.\nCaller: Fine. Let’s book then.\nFront Desk: Perfect. What days work for you?","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":368,"transcription_confidence":0.96,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":null,"client_phone":"[redacted in source]","client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"residential","scope_type":"full_home","scope_summary":"Redo of a 3BHK: kitchen, wardrobes in both bedrooms, living room.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Aundh, Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":1100,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":null,"weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":true,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"pass","service_area":"pass","timeline":"unclear","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"unclear"},"criteria_notes":{"timeline":"No timeline discussed."},"clarifying_question":"When would you need the project complete?","summary":"3BHK in Aundh (~1,100 sq ft): kitchen, two wardrobes, living room. Pressed twice for a price range and was deflected; agreed to book a consultation. Timeline and decision-maker not discussed.","sentiment":"neutral","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.96,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1096,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":1.2013,"created_at":"2026-09-16T06:50:00.000Z"},{"id":"fa0c648b-a804-4600-9abd-67ad0107dde1","enquiry_id":"c32b660c-6ef3-4eeb-a1d9-ee49cd455ab8","source":"audio","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"Front Desk: Good morning, Aangan Studio.\nCaller: Hi — I wanted to inquire about an interior project for my parents. They have a 3BHK in Hadapsar — new possession. They want a proper design.\nFront Desk: That sounds good. Will your parents be involved in the decision?\nCaller: Yes — I’m doing the initial checking. They don’t really use phones much. I’ll tell them about the consultation and they’ll decide.\nFront Desk: Sure — just so we know: your parents would be at the consultation, right? Our designers like to understand the brief directly from the people who’ll live in the space.\nCaller: Yes, they would come. I’m just calling to see if it’s worth pursuing.\nFront Desk: Absolutely. Should I note your details and explain what the consultation involves?\nCaller: Please. (gives number)\nNote: Caller is son. Owners are parents; both will attend consultation. Decision with parents.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":295,"transcription_confidence":0.95,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":null,"client_phone":"[redacted in source]","client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"residential","scope_type":"full_home","scope_summary":"Interior design for parents’ new-possession 3BHK.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Hadapsar, Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":null,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":null,"weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"pass","service_area":"pass","timeline":"unclear","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"unclear"},"criteria_notes":{"decision_maker":"Son is doing initial checking; parents (owners) decide and will attend.","timeline":"No timeline discussed."},"clarifying_question":"When would you need the project complete?","summary":"Son enquiring for his parents’ new 3BHK in Hadapsar. The parents (owners, decision-makers) will attend the consultation. Timeline and area not discussed.","sentiment":"neutral","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.95,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1121,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":0.9957,"created_at":"2026-09-17T06:12:00.000Z"},{"id":"d6257d2d-a394-4167-b815-269fef71f6ac","enquiry_id":"6f94503b-a079-4f8a-a84d-beadf4fe7545","source":"audio","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"Front Desk: Good afternoon, Aangan Studio.\nCaller: Hi, I’m Smita. I’m getting possession of my flat in Undri in about six weeks. 2BHK, 875 sq ft. I want to start the design right away.\nFront Desk: Six weeks is just enough lead time to get the design finalised before execution begins. What are you planning?\nCaller: Full home — kitchen, wardrobes, living room. The full package.\nFront Desk: Good scope. Are you the owner?\nCaller: Yes — my husband and I. He said to go ahead and book the consultation.\nFront Desk: Can we see the site in its current state, or do you need to wait for possession?\nCaller: We can go now — the builder will let us in.\nFront Desk: Even better. Let me get a designer’s availability.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":344,"transcription_confidence":0.97,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":"Smita","client_phone":"[redacted in source]","client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"residential","scope_type":"full_home","scope_summary":"Full-home package for a 2BHK: kitchen, wardrobes, living room.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Undri, Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":875,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":"Possession in ~6 weeks; wants design to start right away.","weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"pass","service_area":"pass","timeline":"pass","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"pass"},"criteria_notes":{},"clarifying_question":null,"summary":"Smita and her husband (owners) take possession of a 2BHK in Undri in ~6 weeks and want the full package (kitchen, wardrobes, living room) designed now. Builder will allow a site visit immediately.","sentiment":"positive","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.97,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1077,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":1.1337,"created_at":"2026-09-18T09:43:00.000Z"},{"id":"c7518a7f-0d86-4f2f-902d-70e9ffce1aa6","enquiry_id":"2c4dbb3c-6136-4b8f-9b55-66e14a096d82","source":"audio","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"Front Desk: Good afternoon, Aangan Studio.\nCaller: Hi — I’d called on Monday about a project. Someone said they’d get back to me. It’s been two days.\nFront Desk: I’m very sorry. Can I get your name?\nCaller: Girish Nair. I called Monday afternoon. I told someone about my 3BHK in Viman Nagar and gave my number.\nFront Desk: I apologise — I don’t see a note. Can you give me your details again? I’ll book the consultation directly now so it doesn’t slip again.\nCaller: This is not a good sign if you forget before you even start.\nFront Desk: You’re absolutely right, and I’m sorry. Let me make this right now.\nNote: Enquiry originally received Monday — no follow-up. Re-logged Friday. Caller frustrated. Handle with care.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":318,"transcription_confidence":0.9,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":"Girish Nair","client_phone":"[redacted in source]","client_email":null,"intent":"follow_up_chase","project_type":"residential","scope_type":null,"scope_summary":null,"scope_clarity":"not_stated","location":"Viman Nagar, Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":null,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":null,"weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"unclear","service_area":"pass","timeline":"unclear","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"unclear"},"criteria_notes":{"real_project":"Only said \"3BHK in Viman Nagar\" — scope never captured.","timeline":"No timeline captured."},"clarifying_question":"Are you looking for a full design-and-execution project for the space, or mainly advice and ideas?","summary":"FRUSTRATED. Girish Nair called on Monday about a 3BHK in Viman Nagar and was never called back; the enquiry was not logged. He chased on Friday (~90h later). Scope and timeline were still never captured. Handle with care.","sentiment":"frustrated","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.9,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1080,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":1.0605,"created_at":"2026-09-15T09:31:00.000Z"},{"id":"8a2b50a3-8fc3-473f-b202-869bcff8abda","enquiry_id":"1ae371f1-5873-4017-8443-7ec01d5bd5e0","source":"audio","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"First call — disconnected at 1 min 12 sec\nFront Desk: Good afternoon, Aangan Studio.\nCaller: Hi, I wanted to inquire about — (line drops)\n\nSecond call — 4 min 30 sec\nFront Desk: Good afternoon, Aangan Studio.\nCaller: Hi — I called just now and got cut off. I’m Ritu Kapoor from Pimple Saudagar. 3BHK, about 1,050 sq ft. We’ve been here two years but never properly did the interiors. We want to start now.\nFront Desk: Thanks for calling back. Pimple Saudagar is in our service area. What are you looking to do?\nCaller: Kitchen, wardrobes, living room. We moved in with builder furniture and it’s very basic.\nFront Desk: Standard full-home scope. Timeline?\nCaller: Ideally done by March. Plenty of time.\nFront Desk: Perfect. Let me book a consultation.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":270,"transcription_confidence":0.96,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":"Ritu Kapoor","client_phone":"[redacted in source]","client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"residential","scope_type":"full_home","scope_summary":"Full-home scope for a 3BHK: kitchen, wardrobes, living room (replacing builder furniture).","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Pimple Saudagar, PCMC","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":1050,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":"Ideally done by March; plenty of time.","weeks_to_completion":23,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"pass","service_area":"pass","timeline":"pass","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"unclear"},"criteria_notes":{},"clarifying_question":null,"summary":"Ritu Kapoor, 3BHK (~1,050 sq ft) in Pimple Saudagar, wants kitchen, wardrobes and living room done by March. Her first call dropped after 1m12s; she called straight back.","sentiment":"positive","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.96,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1088,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":0.9253,"created_at":"2026-09-22T08:47:00.000Z"},{"id":"718429f8-3bb7-429d-9644-472b56deefda","enquiry_id":"2017931f-453e-422c-a3b1-31b43189f819","source":"audio","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"Front Desk: Good morning, Aangan Studio.\nCaller: Hi — I run a small coworking space. I have a 180 sq ft pod I want to make look really nice. Good lighting, a nice desk, some storage. Can you help?\nFront Desk: Our commercial projects are typically 500 sq ft or more. A 180 sq ft pod is below our minimum scope.\nCaller: Not even for a smaller fee?\nFront Desk: It’s not about the fee — it’s that our design and execution team is set up for a certain scale. A 180 sq ft space isn’t one we could do well at the quality we’d want to promise. I’d suggest a local designer who specialises in smaller commercial spaces.\nCaller: Fair enough. Thanks.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":182,"transcription_confidence":0.96,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":null,"client_phone":"[redacted in source]","client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"commercial","scope_type":"office","scope_summary":"Lighting, desk and storage for a 180 sq ft coworking pod.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":null,"location_clarity":"not_stated","in_service_area":null,"area_sqft":180,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":null,"weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"fail","service_area":"unclear","timeline":"unclear","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"unclear"},"criteria_notes":{},"clarifying_question":null,"summary":"Coworking operator wants a 180 sq ft pod made to look good (lighting, desk, storage) — below Aangan’s minimum commercial scope (~500 sq ft). Declined and pointed to a smaller-space specialist.","sentiment":"neutral","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.96,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1060,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":0.6775,"created_at":"2026-09-23T06:26:00.000Z"},{"id":"80b745f0-dc91-4a1d-b63d-d4e38982f1cc","enquiry_id":"6d58c97f-0c9b-4ecb-876f-db89df2637a1","source":"audio","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"Front Desk: Good afternoon, Aangan Studio.\nCaller: Hi — I’m planning to open a restaurant in Koregaon Park. I’ve seen your work and I love it. Would you be able to design the interiors?\nFront Desk: We appreciate you reaching out. Restaurant and hospitality interiors are outside our current scope — we focus on residential and office spaces. For a restaurant you’d need a studio that specialises in commercial hospitality, which has very different material and compliance requirements.\nCaller: Do you know anyone you could refer?\nFront Desk: I don’t have a specific referral I could make confidently, but searching for hospitality interior designers in Pune would give you more relevant options.\nCaller: Alright, thanks.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":170,"transcription_confidence":0.97,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":null,"client_phone":"[redacted in source]","client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"commercial","scope_type":"other","scope_summary":"Restaurant interiors.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Koregaon Park, Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":null,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":null,"weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":["hospitality_or_retail"],"criteria":{"real_project":"fail","service_area":"pass","timeline":"unclear","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"unclear"},"criteria_notes":{},"clarifying_question":null,"summary":"Wants a restaurant designed in Koregaon Park. Restaurants / hospitality are out of Aangan’s scope; declined, no referral given.","sentiment":"neutral","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.97,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1080,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":0.6437,"created_at":"2026-09-24T10:33:00.000Z"},{"id":"4876ff1b-61b9-4925-9baf-9f1eb30d78ba","enquiry_id":"fa9bdd6a-6b5d-40af-ac70-27d56ed61bb9","source":"audio","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"Front Desk: Good morning, Aangan Studio.\nCaller: Good morning. I’m Pooja. I have a 2BHK in Magarpatta — Cybercity area. We’ve been wanting to properly design the interiors for a while. Kitchen, both bedrooms, living room. About 900 sq ft.\nFront Desk: Good scope for us. How soon are you looking to start?\nCaller: We’re flexible — a January start for execution would be ideal.\nFront Desk: That works well. Are you the owner?\nCaller: Yes — my husband and I. We both want to be at the consultation.\nFront Desk: Excellent. Can I book that now?\nCaller: Please.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":284,"transcription_confidence":0.97,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":"Pooja","client_phone":"[redacted in source]","client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"residential","scope_type":"full_home","scope_summary":"Design of a 2BHK: kitchen, both bedrooms, living room.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Magarpatta (Cybercity), Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":900,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":"Flexible; January start for execution.","weeks_to_completion":14,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"pass","service_area":"pass","timeline":