iors for an empty 4BHK.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Viman Nagar, Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":1800,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":"Design in October, execution from November; wants to start ASAP.","weeks_to_completion":17,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":"Sonali Patel (past client, Viman Nagar)","founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"pass","service_area":"pass","timeline":"pass","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"unclear"},"criteria_notes":{},"clarifying_question":null,"summary":"Kiran Mazumdar has an empty 4BHK (~1,800 sq ft) in Viman Nagar and wants full interiors — design in October, execution from November. Referred by past client Sonali Patel. Messaged after hours and waited ~16.5h for a reply. Available weekdays after 6pm or weekends.","sentiment":"positive","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.96,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1144,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":0.1952,"created_at":"2026-09-03T13:45:00.000Z"},{"id":"d8b1b7c0-ae80-4a7b-a81b-ddcdc7e1bf3a","enquiry_id":"7d5e3e49-ac28-4925-8771-7b13b2fd6408","source":"text","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"8 Sept, 2:31pm — Unknown number: hi, how much do you charge per sq ft for a 2bhk?\n[No reply — message missed for 2 days]\n10 Sept, 10:22am — Front Desk: Hi, sorry for the delay in responding. Our pricing depends on materials and scope — our designers go through all of this at a free consultation. Can you tell us about your project?\n[No reply received]\nStatus: Lead unresponsive after follow-up.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":null,"transcription_confidence":0.9,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":null,"client_phone":null,"client_email":null,"intent":"pricing_only","project_type":"residential","scope_type":"full_home","scope_summary":null,"scope_clarity":"not_stated","location":null,"location_clarity":"not_stated","in_service_area":null,"area_sqft":null,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":null,"weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":true,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"unclear","service_area":"unclear","timeline":"unclear","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"unclear"},"criteria_notes":{},"clarifying_question":"Which area is the property in?","summary":"Anonymous number asked only for a per-sq-ft rate for a 2BHK. The first reply took ~44 hours and the prospect never responded. Marked lost.","sentiment":"neutral","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.9,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":999,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":0.1914,"created_at":"2026-09-08T09:02:00.000Z"},{"id":"2ee09917-044d-4937-bd65-6158e40a7522","enquiry_id":"aa092cae-78d4-4dbd-8272-4588356a29ec","source":"text","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"12 Sept, 10:45am — Sunil Yadav: Namaste. Mera flat hai Pimple Nilakh mein. 3BHK. Interior design karwana hai poora ghar. Budget bhi hai. Kaise contact karein?\n12 Sept, 11:02am — Front Desk: Namaste Sunil ji! Zaroor. Pimple Nilakh hamare service area mein hai. Aap kab available hain consultation ke liye? Humara designer aapke flat pe aa sakta hai.\n12 Sept, 11:30am — Sunil Yadav: Koi bhi Saturday subah theek hai.\n12 Sept, 11:35am — Front Desk: Bilkul. Main Saturday 4 October ke liye note karti hoon — morning 10:30 AM. Confirm karo please.\n12 Sept, 11:42am — Sunil Yadav: Confirm hai. Thanks.","processed_text":"Sunil Yadav: Hello. I have a 3BHK flat in Pimple Nilakh. I want interior design for the whole house. I have a budget too. How do I get in touch?\nFront Desk: Hello Sunil! Of course. Pimple Nilakh is in our service area. When are you available for a consultation? Our designer can come to your flat.\nSunil Yadav: Any Saturday morning is fine.\nFront Desk: Certainly. I’ll note Saturday 4 October, morning 10:30 AM. Please confirm.\nSunil Yadav: Confirmed. Thanks.","language":"Hinglish","duration_seconds":null,"transcription_confidence":0.92,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":"Sunil Yadav","client_phone":null,"client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"residential","scope_type":"full_home","scope_summary":"Full-house interior design for a 3BHK.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Pimple Nilakh, PCMC","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":null,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":null,"weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"pass","service_area":"pass","timeline":"unclear","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"unclear"},"criteria_notes":{"timeline":"Consultation confirmed for 4 Oct, but no project timeline given."},"clarifying_question":"When would you need the project complete?","summary":"Sunil Yadav (Hinglish) has a 3BHK in Pimple Nilakh and wants the whole house designed. Mentions a budget exists but gave no figure (not probed). Consultation confirmed for Saturday 4 October, 10:30am. Timeline and area not captured.","sentiment":"positive","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.92,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1049,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":0.1927,"created_at":"2026-09-12T05:16:00.000Z"},{"id":"e72a32f1-c02b-4b2a-a1a6-93fc8ca6f56d","enquiry_id":"e94b0848-6aab-4c4b-a88e-e076b51c9849","source":"text","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"15 Sept, 3:18pm — Chinmay Kulkarni: Hello — do you take up commercial projects in Chinchwad? We have a 1,200 sq ft office space we want to fit out.\n15 Sept, 3:45pm — Front Desk: Yes, Chinchwad is in our service area. We do office fitouts up to around 3,000 sq ft. What’s the current state of the space?\n15 Sept, 3:58pm — Chinmay Kulkarni: Bare shell. Just moved in. Need workstations for 30 people, two cabins, one meeting room.\n15 Sept, 4:03pm — Front Desk: Good scope for us. When are you targeting to be operational?\n15 Sept, 4:12pm — Chinmay Kulkarni: January if possible. Is that doable?\n15 Sept, 4:15pm — Front Desk: Yes — if we start the design process in October, January is achievable. Want to book a site visit?\n15 Sept, 4:22pm — Chinmay Kulkarni: Yes. Can you send me a calendar link?","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":null,"transcription_confidence":0.96,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":"Chinmay Kulkarni","client_phone":null,"client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"commercial","scope_type":"office","scope_summary":"Fitout of a bare-shell office: 30 workstations, two cabins, one meeting room.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Chinchwad, PCMC","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":1200,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":"Operational by January.","weeks_to_completion":16,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"pass","service_area":"pass","timeline":"pass","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"unclear"},"criteria_notes":{},"clarifying_question":null,"summary":"Chinmay Kulkarni needs a 1,200 sq ft bare-shell office in Chinchwad fitted out (30 workstations, 2 cabins, meeting room) by January. Replied to in 27 min; wants a calendar link for a site visit.","sentiment":"positive","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.96,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1099,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":0.194,"created_at":"2026-09-15T09:49:00.000Z"},{"id":"2ea172ba-a345-41b8-b1b3-d65866ba2859","enquiry_id":"22a93f14-95f8-4439-ae8b-338582d058e4","source":"text","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"20 Sept, 6:44pm (Saturday) — Meena Joshi: Hello — I wanted to inquire about getting my home designed. 2BHK in Baner. Please let me know if you can help and what the process is.\n[No reply — Saturday after hours]\n22 Sept, 10:15am (Monday) — Front Desk: Hi Meena, sorry for the delay — we’re closed over the weekend. We’d love to help with your 2BHK in Baner. Can you tell me more about what you’re looking to design?\n[No reply]\n22 Sept, 3:00pm — Front Desk: Hi Meena, just following up on my earlier message.\n[No reply]\nStatus: Lead lost. No response after two follow-up messages.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":null,"transcription_confidence":0.93,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":"Meena Joshi","client_phone":null,"client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"residential","scope_type":"full_home","scope_summary":"Wants her 2BHK designed; scope unspecified.","scope_clarity":"not_stated","location":"Baner, Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":null,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":null,"weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"unclear","service_area":"pass","timeline":"unclear","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"unclear"},"criteria_notes":{},"clarifying_question":"Are you looking for a full design-and-execution project for the space, or mainly advice and ideas?","summary":"Meena Joshi asked about getting her 2BHK in Baner designed on a Saturday evening; the first reply came ~39.5h later and two follow-ups got no answer. Marked lost.","sentiment":"neutral","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.93,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1045,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":0.1926,"created_at":"2026-09-20T13:15:00.000Z"},{"id":"dec108c9-c993-416d-8558-bf7d3a2ecca0","enquiry_id":"99423e16-e4e0-4e0f-bf97-8d479392092f","source":"text","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"17 Sept, 11:22am — Tanvi Kulkarni: Hi — Ashok Bhosale asked me to message directly. We’ve just bought a 3BHK in Koregaon Park — possession next month. We want end-to-end design. Ashok said you’re the best, so no need to look further.\n17 Sept, 11:41am — Front Desk: Hi Tanvi — Ashok’s trust means a lot to us. Congratulations on the new flat! When’s possession?\n17 Sept, 11:55am — Tanvi Kulkarni: October 15th.\n17 Sept, 12:01pm — Front Desk: Perfect. Can we schedule a site visit for the week of October 20?\n17 Sept, 12:09pm — Tanvi Kulkarni: Yes — 21st or 22nd works.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":null,"transcription_confidence":0.97,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":"Tanvi Kulkarni","client_phone":null,"client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"residential","scope_type":"full_home","scope_summary":"End-to-end design of a newly bought 3BHK.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Koregaon Park, Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":null,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":"Possession 15 October; site visit 21–22 October.","weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":"Ashok Bhosale","founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":[],"criteria":{"real_project":"pass","service_area":"pass","timeline":"pass","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"pass"},"criteria_notes":{},"clarifying_question":null,"summary":"Tanvi Kulkarni just bought a 3BHK in Koregaon Park (possession 15 Oct) and wants end-to-end design; referred by Ashok Bhosale and not shopping around. Site visit pencilled for 21 or 22 October.","sentiment":"positive","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.97,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1042,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":0.1925,"created_at":"2026-09-17T05:53:00.000Z"},{"id":"c8b17653-c411-4535-9ce1-0b696531590f","enquiry_id":"785f1334-8c75-4117-be7c-34dc94d7d4ed","source":"text","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"5 Sept, 4:52pm — Rohit Singh: Hi — I’m opening a gym in Kothrud. About 2,500 sq ft. Would you design the interiors? Looking for something modern and high-energy.\n6 Sept, 10:30am — Front Desk: Hi Rohit — we focus on residential and office interiors. Gym and fitness spaces have specific requirements — equipment anchoring, rubber flooring, safety specs — that we’re not set up for. You’d need a specialist for this one. Sorry we can’t help.\n6 Sept, 10:44am — Rohit Singh: Ok thanks.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":null,"transcription_confidence":0.97,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":"Rohit Singh","client_phone":null,"client_email":null,"intent":"new_project","project_type":"commercial","scope_type":"other","scope_summary":"Interiors for a new gym.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Kothrud, Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":2500,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":null,"weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unknown","referral_source":null,"founder_connection":false,"asked_for_pricing":false,"competitive":false,"custom_work_flags":["hospitality_or_retail"],"criteria":{"real_project":"fail","service_area":"pass","timeline":"unclear","budget":"unclear","decision_maker":"unclear"},"criteria_notes":{},"clarifying_question":null,"summary":"Rohit Singh is opening a 2,500 sq ft gym in Kothrud. Gyms are out of Aangan’s scope; declined.","sentiment":"neutral","ambiguity_flags":[],"field_confidence":{},"transcription_confidence":0.97,"inaudible_count":0},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","input_tokens":1021,"output_tokens":750,"ai_cost_inr":0.192,"created_at":"2026-09-05T11:23:00.000Z"},{"id":"9909779d-d820-4c20-86f1-2f67a5f82934","enquiry_id":"6e089d5c-355b-446f-9852-803f62a1aa5d","source":"text","audio_url":null,"raw_text":"10 Sept, 8:44am — Pradeep Garg: Hello — I messaged 4 days ago about my flat in Aundh. No one replied. Is anyone monitoring this number?\n10 Sept, 10:02am — Front Desk: Hi Pradeep — I sincerely apologise. Your earlier message doesn’t appear in this thread — it may have gone to a different number. Please tell me about your project and I’ll make sure we respond promptly.\n10 Sept, 10:17am — Pradeep Garg: It was this number. 2BHK in Aundh. 850 sq ft. Full interiors. But now I’m not sure I want to work with a studio that doesn’t reply for 4 days.\n10 Sept, 10:21am — Front Desk: I completely understand. This isn’t the experience we want anyone to have. If you’re open to it, I’d like to connect you directly with our designer today — not in a few days. Would that work?\n10 Sept, 10:35am — Pradeep Garg: Fine. Yes.\nNote: Lead highly frustrated. Response-time failure. Escalate to senior designer for same-day outreach.","processed_text":null,"language":"en","duration_seconds":null,"transcription_confidence":0.94,"field_confidence":{},"ambiguity_flags":[],"extraction":{"client_name":"Pradeep Garg","client_phone":null,"client_email":null,"intent":"follow_up_chase","project_type":"residential","scope_type":"full_home","scope_summary":"Full interiors for a 2BHK.","scope_clarity":"clear","location":"Aundh, Pune","location_clarity":"clear","in_service_area":true,"area_sqft":850,"style_preferences":[],"timeline_text":null,"weeks_to_completion":null,"budget_low_inr":null,"budget_high_inr":null,"budget_flexibility":"unk